      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Was recommend to this company by a colleague who had done the research, but thought I'd use the whole Solar Quotes website advice and do the full exercise.Solar Quotes did not recommend getting a quote from Sunny Solar they picked 3 others, (Clearly Solar Quotes need to do a bit more research)When we finally got 3 quotes and yes even though Solar Quotes recommend these 3, we had to chase one of them several times to get a quote.The frustrating part of this exercise is that it is near impossible to compare Apples with Apples. We went through and decided which panel manufacturer we wanted and Inverter. (6.6kW Q Cell Peak Duo G5 Panels & Fronius Primo 5kW Inverter) Once we got quotes from everyone (including Sunny Solar) it was easy to see who was in the race and who was out.Two companies quoted us the same price (Sunny Solar & Replenishable Energy), so we wrote back to each and asked them to reconsider their quotes and submit again via email.The Winner was Sunny Solar.They advised us it would be approx 3 weeks (to allow for Nth QLD wet season) and true to their word they were here on time and installed in 1 day...fantastic.Next day their sales rep came around and set up my App and bingo we are making power big time (most for us and some back into the grid....exactly what we wanted.Highly Recommended.",
