      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I was looking for a local Cairns company and got a quote from Matt which ended up being the cheapest of all quotes. I am usually a little cautious of the cheapest quotes, but given I had limited shading issues and after further review and a few questions to Matt, I decided to proceed with them. To be honest, I couldn't be happier with the install and the system (Fronius 5kw inverter and GCL Q series 325w panels). Jason and Damien were the installers who took pride in their work. We had a few little issues with the install given the age of my roof (ie the issue was with my house and not the solar system), but Jason & Damien kept me informed and came up with a solution and fixed it and no extra charge. Matt (the electrician) also took pride in his work and everyone left the house in a clean and tidy condition.In terms of the system, I have had it for just over 1 month and I am averaging 27kw per day, noting the average for Cairns this time of year is around 23kw, however I do note that we have had a lot of cloud free days in August.",
